mindmap
  root((Logic Gates))
    Fundamental Gates
      AND: output 1 only if all inputs 1
      OR: output 1 if any input 1
      NOT: Inverter complement
      NAND: complement of AND - universal
      NOR: complement of OR - universal
      XOR: output 1 if inputs differ
      XNOR: output 1 if inputs equal
    Universal Gates
      NAND alone implements any Boolean function
      NOR alone implements any Boolean function
    Three-State Gates
      Output states: 0 1 High-Impedance Z
      Enable input controls bus connection
      Essential for shared bus architectures
    Positive and Negative Logic
      Positive: HIGH = 1 LOW = 0
      Negative: HIGH = 0 LOW = 1
      Duality Principle: AND-OR swap
    Logic Families
      TTL
        Bipolar Junction Transistors
        5V Supply
        Propagation Delay 10ns
        Subfamilies: 74xx 74LSxx 74Sxx
      CMOS
        Complementary MOSFET Pairs
        3-15V Supply
        Near-Zero Static Power
        Subfamilies: 4000 74HC 74AC 74LVC
    Electrical Characteristics
      Propagation Delay tPLH tPHL
      Fan-Out: max driven inputs
      Noise Margin: immunity to voltage noise
      Power Dissipation: static plus dynamic